   "text": "9) I am not interested in anyone's assumptions, projections, strawmanning, red herrings, ad hominiem, or character assassination attempts based on any topic that I am not discussing. (For example, my discussion of postpartum mental health in general is NOT an invitation to project whatever issues you have with any legal case onto me as if they are my issues.)",
