   "text": "Abortion has always meant - to terminate a pregnancy with the intended result of a dead fetus. She is attempting to redefine it to include procedures that end pregnancies for any reason at any point with the intention of convincing more women they needed abortions, as if their 40+ week emergency C-section was an abortion while they hold their loving, breathing infant. It is diabolical. \n\nRather than help women understand the difference between a procedure intended to save as many lives as possible and one deeicated to ending their child's life, she wants to muddy the waters for political gain.",
