   "text": "I can't believe it has been a year since the crossroads of devastating news and innovating solutions birthed a whole second business for our family! Help us celebrate our first year of uniting unique, vintage items with lovely, unique individuals:\n\nhttps://www.facebook.com/share/p/1BsN85QgUx/i\n\n📣Celebrating 1 Year on of Robin's Roominations!🎉 \nTo say thank you for an amazing first year of sharing a passion for finding loving homes for unique, vintage items, we are launching a best customer event: a 1ST YEAR ANNIVERSAY SALE!\n\n🔥Take 35% OFF ANY ORDER OF $50 OR MORE! 🔥\nDiscount automatically applies at checkout once your cart hits $50 or more in items from our little shop.\n\nhttps://robinsroominations.etsy.com",
