   "conversationId": "2100023587700658623",
   "text": "My 16 yr old is a huge fan of Back to the Future (specifically the 2nd one) and @realmikefox. So much so that I hunted down Guess jeans 48 hours before and my daughter tailored this puffer vest 24 hours before we left for our trip that included an amazing Back to the Future Escape Room. \n\nThis isn't just a cosplay for him. He wears some version of this most days. It is what he is most comfortable in as he espresses his nerdy cool.\n\nI consider us all blessed to have had the opportunity to witness Michael, Tracey, and Justine model humanity for my generation and my children's generation.",
