   "text": "The excellent news is that you ar already the father of a baby girl and clearly are already prioritizing her needs. This is an excellent sign for the future.\n\nLet her see how men should treat women by watching how you treat @buttonslives. \n\nBe on her team especially when that means helping her navigate the mistakes she will make. Part of provising safety for a daughter as a father is being willing to acknowledge her mistakes with mercy and by being willing to help her learn and grow from them with grace.",
