   "url": "https://x.com/TruthAgape/status/2097478076217307201",
   "conversationId": "2097294578286022934",
   "text": "I adore you. I am fine if we see this differently. Currently, I think we are talking past one another. I am talking about personal experiences of individuals. Yes, social patterns regarding threats and violence exist. I am NOT suggesting anyone trust their children to strangers. \n\nHowever, it is still a very real experience that men who are not predators are assumed to be if they take delight in the antics/joys of small children and women are not. It is the assumed guilt of thought crimes or bad intent. I understand it. I also think it is unfortunate.\n\nIf I blame anyone, it is legislators for passing the most pathetic sentencing ever for violent crimes against children.",
   "lang": "en",
