   "text": "This is a performance of building strawmen and demanding others answer for them, not a conversation. \n\nHowever, it is also a helpful illustration of what young people think socialism would be like. \n\nThey think it will be having everything they need/want while they yell at those providing it for free. \n\nThey feel entitled and virtuous via virtue signaling their \"approved messaging.\" This is how propoganda works.",
