   "conversationId": "2095699498500509876",
   "text": "I have always, to my now well deserved chagrin, judged Steinem based on her views of abortion.\n\nI absolutely love learning someone I differ from in many ways has an opinion in common. \n\nIt is a much needed reminder we are all human with diverse views and likely have something in common with one another.\n\nI am praying for Gloria's family and friends tonight. I entrust her into God's hands. He loves her and knows her so much better than I even attemped to. I wish her rest and peace in the eternal.",
